{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["And Yisrael saw — even though it is written above: ולא יוכל לראות. One can see a person's form and not recognize the form of his face. Similarly: לא יראני האדם. And it is written: ראיתי את ה׳."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {0 "The two scriptural citations are unaddressed in the Hebrew; they are Exodus 33:20 (לא יראני האדם) and Exodus 24:10 (for ראיתי את ה׳, an approximate quotation of ויראו את אלהי ישראל in that verse)."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:30.262856141Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}